      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED SAID SO (3) goes very well this trip starting 40 times for 14 wins and 12 minors. Placed last time (17.02) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 3.5 lengths. Looks the one to beat with even luck. AFIRE (1) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at this track over 300m behind Paw Qwan (17.51) in a Grade 5. Goes very well from this draw with seven wins and four minor placings from 15 starts. Warrants plenty of respect. ZIPPING BOTHAM (7) was beaten for speed from wide out but attacked the line strongly to place, 2 lengths from the winner (30.98) at Angle Park in Grade 4/5. Has won two of three starts from this draw. Well-placed to take this out. PAW MANTRA (5) has top-three claims while fresh from a 12 weeks break.",
